      "timestamp": 1775762761419,
      "source": "manual",
      "category": "security",
      "content": "Full security audit 2026-04-10 — Fixed: P0 password validation (auth-password.ts truthiness bug), P0 admin header PII leakage (proxy.ts), P0 OAuth CSRF bypass (auth callback). Remaining: ADMIN_EMAIL_DOMAINS allows domain-based admin elevation (authz.ts:55-67), static Rithmic PBKDF2 salt (rithmic/encryption-key/route.ts), no app-level rate limit on auth endpoints, TOKEN_CRYPTO_KEY now enforces min 32 chars, userIdCache now has 5min TTL + 10K cap."
    },
    {
      "timestamp": 1775762761636,
      "source": "manual",
      "category": "bugs",
      "content": "Fixed bugs 2026-04-10: (1) server/auth-password.ts lines 138,164 — validatePasswordStrength() returns always-truthy object, password changes were silently broken for ALL users. Fixed to check .valid property. (2) server/auth-user.ts line 504 — updateUserLanguage only allowed en/fr but app supports 11 locales. Expanded to full locale set. (3) app/[locale]/(home)/components/Navigation.tsx — linked to /features (non-existent) and /blog (should be /blogs)."
    },
